      "text": "Container 1: poker-risk:<git-sha>\nGo risk-kafka / risk-scorer\n\n• collect exactly 15 pairs / hand\n• verify model + feature contract\n• local ONNX or localhost Triton\n• calibrate + decision policy\n• publish, then commit offsets\n• deterministic replay + recovery",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Container 1: poker-risk:<git-sha>\nGo risk-kafka / risk-scorer\n\n• collect exactly 15 pairs / hand\n• verify model + feature contract\n• local ONNX or localhost Triton\n• calibrate + decision policy\n• publish, then commit offsets\n• deterministic replay + recovery",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
